        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.littlecanadamn.org/244/Historical-Society"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Every August, Little Canada hosts Canadian Days, celebrating its sister city Thunder Bay, Ontario.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Canada%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city’s emblem features an LC on a white fleur‑de‑lis set against a red maple leaf, echoing the Canadian flag.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
